  "description_html": "<section aria-labelledby=\"courseDescription\">\n    Prerequisite: A grade of C or above in MATH 1113 or higher level mathematics course.\n\nA study of topics basic to mathematics and computer science. The topics include logic, proofs, mathematical induction, set theory, combinatorics, relations, and graph theory. \n\nNote: A grade of C of better must be earned in this course if being used to satisfy the general education mathematics requirement.\n    \n</section>",
